<%#
  The City picker as a page of its own. Two ways here: the pill, on a page
  without JavaScript — closing goes back to the screen it was tapped on —
  and the home screen of somebody who has never picked a city while there
  is more than one, who is asked once, before any week is drawn.
%>
<main class="city-page">
  <%= erb :_city_picker, locals: { back: @back, mode: @first_run ? :first_run : :page } %>
</main>
